<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD JATS (Z39.96) Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v1.0 20120330//EN" "JATS-archivearticle1.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">West J Emerg Med</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">WestJEM</journal-id><journal-title-group><journal-title>Western Journal of Emergency Medicine</journal-title></journal-title-group><issn pub-type="ppub">1936-900X</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1936-9018</issn><publisher><publisher-name>Department of Emergency Medicine, University of California, Irvine School of Medicine</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2672255</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">wjem-9-0129</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Erratum</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Erratum</article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>5</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><volume>9</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>129</fpage><lpage>129</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2008 the authors.</copyright-statement><license license-type="open-access" xlink:href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0"><license-p><!--CREATIVE COMMONS-->This is an Open Access article distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Non-Commercial Attribution License, which permits its use in any digital medium, provided the original work is properly cited and not altered. For details, please refer to <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0/">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0/.</ext-link> Authors grant <italic>Western Journal of Emergency Medicine</italic> as well as the National Library of Medicine a nonexclusive license to publish the manuscript.</license-p></license></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p>Author Jarrod Larson was missing from the list of authors on <related-article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="9" page="1" id="d32e53" xlink:href="19561694" ext-link-type="pubmed">page 1, Volume IX, Issue 1</related-article> of the <italic>Western Journal of Emergency Medicine</italic>. The correct list of authors for &#x0201c;Accuracy Retrospective Analysis of 575 Studies&#x0201d; is as follows:</p><p>William Scruggs, MD</p><p>J. Christian Fox, MD</p><p>Brian Potts, MD</p><p>Alexander Zlidenny, MD</p><p>JoAnne McDonough, MD</p><p>Craig L. Anderson, MPH, PhD</p><p>Jarrod Larson, BS</p><p>Graciela Barajas, BS</p><p>Mark I. Langdorf, MD, MPHE</p></body></article>